2026-11-25T11:10:11.8730310Z [36;1mprintf '%s\n' \[0m
2026-11-25T11:10:11.8730951Z [36;1m  'This workflow requires public component gates, five clean-Linux gates including UFS runtime suspend/read-wake and active plus runtime-suspended real Linux UFS checkpoint/continuation; read each result.json for its actual verdict.' \[0m
2026-11-25T11:10:11.8731762Z [36;1m  'Missing binaries, skipped C QTests, failed checks, timeouts or changed QEMU binaries fail the job.' \[0m
2026-11-25T11:10:11.8732345Z [36;1m  'The board uses an architectural Cortex-A77 model and A55 small-core substitutes; exact counter rate is measured in QEMU virtual time.' \[0m
2026-11-25T11:10:11.8733048Z [36;1m  'GENI, GCC, timers, SMMUv2, reference RPMh, UFS, watchdog, TLMM, PDC, IMEM, PS_HOLD, DCC, IPCC and reference SPMI gates test their implemented digital contracts.' \[0m
2026-11-25T11:10:11.8733905Z [36;1m  'Linux checks use eight CPUs, 8 GiB RAM, a generated device tree and a synthetic disk. The UFS I/O gates end with host QMP quit after 19 ordinary, 23 RPMh-enabled or 40 runtime-PM guest checks.' \[0m
2026-11-25T11:10:11.8734776Z [36;1m  'The runtime-PM gate requires host/LUN/device-WLUN suspend, ordinary direct-I/O wake, gated core/iface/unipro clocks and complete 64 MiB media comparison; it does not test system suspend.' \[0m
2026-11-25T11:10:11.8735758Z [36;1m  'The UFS checkpoint gates resume the same PID 1, nonce and boot ID in a new process, then perform direct block I/O; only quiescent UFS queues are supported.' \[0m
2026-11-25T11:10:11.8736586Z [36;1m  'The runtime-suspended mode adds 22 guest checks and preserves the open fd, Hibern8 and gated clocks before ordinary read wake; neither mode establishes system suspend or in-flight request serialization.' \[0m
2026-11-25T11:10:11.8737612Z [36;1m  'Additional component gates require crypto rejection, Auto-Hibern8, retained RPMh wake requests and opt-in TBU HALT/ECATS with process checkpoint rejection tests.' \[0m
2026-11-25T11:10:11.8738456Z [36;1m  'No private production Image or AOP input is used. Stock Android, full native-DT boot, analog behavior, Adreno and complete-device equivalence are not attested.' \[0m
